WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:05:40.757 --> 00:05:45.720
- I'm excited for you.

00:05:46.220 --> 00:05:48.306
I was excited for Devin. And to see you

00:05:48.306 --> 00:05:49.849
guys both get the Rookie of the

00:05:49.849 --> 00:05:51.142
Years, man. It's the only award

00:05:51.142 --> 00:05:55.688
you can win once, clearly. You can only be a

00:05:55.688 --> 00:05:57.023
rookie once, you know what I mean?

00:05:57.065 --> 00:05:59.567
So, to be able to snag that award,

00:05:59.567 --> 00:06:01.069
man, I'm excited for you guys.

00:06:01.069 --> 00:06:02.779
I'm excited for the future of the game.

00:06:03.237 --> 00:06:05.365
Definitely gonna be watching. And Doc,

00:06:05.907 --> 00:06:08.117
watching you do what you did and hearing

00:06:08.117 --> 00:06:20.213
you say you only did it with two pitches—
- [Laughing]
- That’s even more, like, that’s even more special.

